// @id 01KXKD3ACVRQPKE64VXKBW9GQ3
q: ==Radiation dosimetry== in the fields of health physics and radiation protection is the measurement, calculation and assessment of the ionizing radiation dose absorbed by an object, usually the human body.
e: This applies both internally, due to ingested or inhaled radioactive substances, or externally due to irradiation by sources of radiation.

// @id 01KXKD3ACVZ45PADCRH7TXWQCX
q: NASA’s ==Deep Space Network (DSN)== is a worldwide network of spacecraft communication ground segment facilities that supports NASA's interplanetary spacecraft missions.
e: The DSN consists of three facilities spaced equidistant from each other – approximately 120 degrees apart in longitude – around the world. It also performs radio and radar astronomy observations for the exploration of the Solar System and the universe, and supports selected Earth-orbiting missions.
